{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063444/block/singleImage/3265407/df/01M77C8E9AV0QK5T6JY4J1DXQK.png?updatedAt=1794471260\"/><figcaption>西區般咸道八旬婦墮樓，倒臥平台當場不治。(Google街景截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (12 日 ) 上午 10 時 39 分，警方接獲保安報案，指發現一名女子倒臥在西區般咸道景輝大廈一平台，懷疑她從高處墮下。 人員接報到場，該名 86 歲姓郭女子現場被證實死亡。人員經初步調查，相信事主從上址一單位墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主生前受病患困擾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.736317+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:00:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:57.277738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:28.061334+00:00","content_hash":"672ae0518e7502742e4f8283c58a1edc7ee1bfd37dadcf105262df55c7362da6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.736317+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}